WEBVTT

00:08.675 --> 00:16.716
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.716 --> 00:24.714
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.232 --> 00:36.036
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.036 --> 00:39.039
Believing, dreaming

00:39.039 --> 00:42.876
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:42.876 --> 00:48.007
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.816 --> 00:58.224
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.224 --> 01:02.796
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.796 --> 01:05.465
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.465 --> 01:13.740
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.740 --> 01:18.700
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.246 --> 01:26.879
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:55.648 --> 01:58.583
Murdered by the one you love...

01:59.052 --> 02:01.680
This will be the ultimate revenge.

02:04.257 --> 02:06.725
You are going to be of use to me.

02:22.942 --> 02:28.574
The 6th Night
The Targeted Girl

02:29.482 --> 02:33.282
How cute! She's just like a doll!

02:35.155 --> 02:37.453
My name is Reiya Oshima.

02:37.857 --> 02:42.817
Um... I heard that you solve
all sorts of unusual cases.

02:43.897 --> 02:47.467
Leave it to us.
We'll solve any kind of case!

02:47.467 --> 02:49.094
Right, Loki?

02:55.375 --> 02:56.672
Loki?

02:57.143 --> 02:58.545
What's the matter?

02:58.545 --> 03:00.180
It's nothing.

03:00.180 --> 03:02.448
Come on, get with it.

03:02.448 --> 03:05.144
So, what kind of case do you
want us to solve?

03:06.085 --> 03:08.645
Yes, well, actually...

03:10.356 --> 03:13.848
At first I thought it was
just my imagination.

03:14.861 --> 03:16.089
But...

03:37.116 --> 03:39.519
The furniture moved on its own too,

03:39.519 --> 03:42.255
and I heard the sound of footsteps
walking all around.

03:42.255 --> 03:45.091
Awesome! A poltergeist!

03:45.091 --> 03:47.093
It's a strange mystery!

03:47.093 --> 03:48.390
Mayura!

03:49.162 --> 03:52.029
Please help me!

03:53.733 --> 03:55.200
Loki...

03:55.668 --> 03:57.135
Master Loki?

04:00.440 --> 04:01.975
Very well.

04:01.975 --> 04:03.602
Let's go check it out.

04:09.182 --> 04:12.285
Master Loki? About that girl, Reiya...

04:12.285 --> 04:14.053
Yeah, I know.

04:14.053 --> 04:17.489
She's the Norse goddess, Freya.

04:18.825 --> 04:20.660
What is she doing in that form?

04:20.660 --> 04:25.188
What's more, she didn't even recognize you.

04:26.199 --> 04:28.568
Perhaps her memories have been erased.

04:28.568 --> 04:30.737
Who would do such a thing?

04:30.737 --> 04:32.872
I don't know why they'd do it,

04:32.872 --> 04:36.171
but there are very few who could
erase a god's memories.

04:36.409 --> 04:37.603
You don't mean...

04:38.144 --> 04:39.441
Odin.

04:49.022 --> 04:52.321
Heimdall, I'm going out for a little while.

04:52.525 --> 04:54.618
Going to look for Freya again?

04:54.994 --> 04:57.163
If I don't find her soon,

04:57.163 --> 05:02.294
she will most certainly be lost and
alone in the human world.

05:04.270 --> 05:06.238
What are you making?

05:07.507 --> 05:09.134
What are you making?

05:10.443 --> 05:13.970
A jewel box to hold the Brising necklace.

05:18.685 --> 05:21.187
That's a pretty unusual shape.

05:21.187 --> 05:22.654
Just leave me alone.

05:25.224 --> 05:26.626
Well, no matter.

05:26.626 --> 05:30.653
But that necklace is mine, so make
sure that you're careful with it.

05:34.967 --> 05:40.132
Of course I'll be careful...
so I can kill Loki with it.

05:54.921 --> 05:57.123
This is your home, Reiya?

05:57.123 --> 05:59.659
No, this is a hotel, isn't it?

05:59.659 --> 06:01.828
There was a strange fire at our mansion.

06:01.828 --> 06:04.564
It was so scary.
And then we moved here.

06:04.564 --> 06:06.165
A strange fire?

06:06.165 --> 06:09.601
But you've seen strange things here too?

06:09.936 --> 06:11.233
Yes...

06:12.538 --> 06:14.273
It's okay, don't worry!

06:14.273 --> 06:17.470
Loki will solve this case lickety-split!

06:18.144 --> 06:20.446
Anyhow, let's just go inside for now.

06:20.446 --> 06:23.108
Okay. Please come this way, Loki.

06:24.417 --> 06:26.319
Um... Wait a second.

06:26.319 --> 06:29.155
I'm going to have a look at
things out here first.

06:29.155 --> 06:30.790
Loki!

06:30.790 --> 06:33.258
Come on, don't just stand there!

06:34.026 --> 06:35.152
Whoa, hold...

06:38.331 --> 06:40.400
What are you doing? Let's go.

06:40.400 --> 06:41.734
What was that?

06:41.734 --> 06:43.361
C'mon already!

06:43.536 --> 06:44.737
Whoa, hold on! Mayura! Wait!

06:44.737 --> 06:46.671
Here we go!
Whoa, hold on! Mayura! Wait!

06:47.039 --> 06:50.143
Miss Reiya! Where have you been?

06:50.143 --> 06:52.478
I was so worried!

06:52.478 --> 06:54.614
I'm sorry, Mino.

06:54.614 --> 06:57.383
Don't tell me you three...

06:57.383 --> 06:58.951
No, it's not like that, Mino!

06:58.951 --> 07:02.388
Loki is a detective, and
he's here to help me!

07:02.388 --> 07:07.348
I've been told that unusual things have
been happening around Reiya lately.

07:08.227 --> 07:12.425
This is not the place to talk.
Please, come in.

07:18.604 --> 07:20.473
Nothing has happened at all?

07:20.473 --> 07:23.876
No. Not a single person, myself included,

07:23.876 --> 07:28.040
has seen any of the unusual phenomena
Miss Reiya is talking about.

07:34.487 --> 07:39.158
But didn't you move here because of
a strange fire at your old home?

07:39.158 --> 07:40.426
That was the result of

07:40.426 --> 07:42.595
a member of the housekeeping staff not
putting out their cigarette properly.

07:42.595 --> 07:44.730
There was nothing unusual about it at all.

07:44.730 --> 07:48.689
So all those other things were
just Reiya's imagination?

07:49.168 --> 07:51.771
She was examined by a doctor,
and his conclusion was

07:51.771 --> 07:54.001
that she suffers from a slight neurosis.

07:54.407 --> 07:55.874
No way.

08:00.580 --> 08:05.418
I'm frightfully sorry that you've
come all this way for nothing.

08:05.418 --> 08:08.046
Hey, Loki, what are you going to do now?
Will you go back?

08:09.622 --> 08:11.090
Loki?

08:11.090 --> 08:13.526
Loki, please don't go back!

08:13.526 --> 08:15.161
Reiya...

08:15.161 --> 08:17.721
Miss Reiya, this is all just your imagination.

08:17.997 --> 08:19.464
No it isn't!

08:22.935 --> 08:25.563
I am not lying!

08:26.606 --> 08:29.632
Please help me, Loki!

08:31.043 --> 08:32.305
Loki!

08:43.990 --> 08:47.721
It's okay. I'll solve this case for you.

08:47.860 --> 08:49.418
You mean it?

08:51.097 --> 08:52.698
Mr. Loki...

08:52.698 --> 08:54.100
Loki!

08:54.100 --> 08:56.102
You two can go back now.

08:56.102 --> 08:59.705
I know the situation, so I'll
be staying here myself.

08:59.705 --> 09:03.543
Huh? If you're staying here,
then I am too!

09:03.543 --> 09:05.211
Master Loki, allow me to stay as well.

09:05.211 --> 09:09.170
No, you go back and get a change of clothes
and whatever else I may need.

09:10.583 --> 09:12.073
But Master Loki...

09:12.752 --> 09:14.587
I'm kind of stuck here.

09:14.587 --> 09:18.045
I want you to go back and see what
Heimdall and Frey are up to.

09:18.257 --> 09:22.562
Very well. Now I see.

09:22.562 --> 09:24.363
And so, Mayura, you'll also be...

09:24.363 --> 09:28.200
Leave it to me! I'll do my best
to fill in for Yamino!

09:28.200 --> 09:30.336
Uh, that's not what I meant...

09:30.336 --> 09:32.238
Don't you worry, Reiya!

09:32.238 --> 09:35.741
I'll solve that mystery good!

09:35.741 --> 09:37.810
Thank you, Mayura!

09:37.810 --> 09:39.209
Jeesh...

10:05.972 --> 10:09.806
These paranormal phenomena always
occur after she falls asleep.

10:10.509 --> 10:13.637
Since we're in the room next door to her, we
should know as soon as something happens.

10:15.348 --> 10:16.315
Mayura?

10:19.485 --> 10:22.454
Jeez, what was the point in
you even staying here?

10:25.224 --> 10:28.527
At last we see the phantom's true form...

10:28.527 --> 10:30.663
the enigmatic apeman, Pargon...

10:30.663 --> 10:32.130
Prepare yourself!

10:33.332 --> 10:34.959
Pargon?

10:46.479 --> 10:47.446
Reiya!

10:48.481 --> 10:49.448
Reiya!

10:50.983 --> 10:51.950
Are you okay?

10:56.656 --> 10:58.691
I had such a scary dream!

10:58.691 --> 11:02.149
Someone was calling to me the whole time!

11:03.996 --> 11:08.695
When I listened to that voice,
I wasn't myself anymore!

11:11.003 --> 11:14.302
It's okay, Reiya. Just relax.

12:21.107 --> 12:22.108
Loki!

12:22.108 --> 12:23.234
Begone!

12:39.058 --> 12:40.292
No way!

12:40.292 --> 12:42.495
Something like that happened?

12:42.495 --> 12:44.520
Loki, you are so, so, so unfair!

12:44.830 --> 12:46.599
What are you talking about?

12:46.599 --> 12:49.659
Hey, you're the one who fell asleep!

12:50.536 --> 12:52.663
That was the blunder of a lifetime!

12:54.206 --> 12:58.165
I didn't sense any evil at all
coming from those things.

13:00.479 --> 13:01.639
Why?

13:03.015 --> 13:04.346
Loki!

13:04.850 --> 13:06.477
Good morning, Reiya!

13:07.620 --> 13:10.088
Thanks for your help last night.

13:10.489 --> 13:12.286
Are you feeling a little better now?

13:12.658 --> 13:15.286
Yes. Thanks to you.

13:16.395 --> 13:19.159
You protected me.

13:20.499 --> 13:23.297
You're my prince.

13:24.670 --> 13:27.006
Would you care for another cup of tea?

13:27.006 --> 13:28.633
Yes, please.

13:31.544 --> 13:32.841
Hey, yeah!

13:34.013 --> 13:35.207
What is it, Mayura?

13:36.682 --> 13:39.952
I just thought of a great way to
gather some information!

13:39.952 --> 13:42.288
This case is as good as solved!

13:42.288 --> 13:43.255
See you later, Loki!

13:45.858 --> 13:48.561
What's with Mayura?

13:48.561 --> 13:50.028
Search me.

13:50.362 --> 13:52.631
Can I ask you a question?

13:52.631 --> 13:54.633
Yes, what is it?

13:54.633 --> 14:00.139
Do you remember anything about the mansion
you were living in before, or about your past?

14:00.139 --> 14:02.266
My past?

14:04.109 --> 14:06.612
I don't really remember anything.

14:06.612 --> 14:08.102
Not even a little bit?

14:08.514 --> 14:11.183
Not too long ago I was in
a terrible accident,

14:11.183 --> 14:13.981
and I forgot everything about my past.

14:14.286 --> 14:15.617
I see...

14:16.355 --> 14:21.588
I try to remember, but whenever I do,
my head starts to hurt.

14:36.976 --> 14:38.978
The show begins now.

14:38.978 --> 14:42.937
And I'll see that you use as much
magic as you can, Loki.

15:02.067 --> 15:03.702
If I'm one of the staff,

15:03.702 --> 15:07.035
I can get the scoop on things they
can't tell customers about!

15:11.343 --> 15:12.401
Huh?

15:15.414 --> 15:17.439
Taking a break at this hour?

15:17.850 --> 15:23.482
Perfect! Now I'll have them tell me
all of this hotel's secrets!

15:34.400 --> 15:37.369
That's strange.
Why are they going in there?

15:37.770 --> 15:39.071
Oh well!

15:39.071 --> 15:41.039
I'll find out if I go in too!

15:44.243 --> 15:45.369
No way!

15:51.183 --> 15:53.310
What the heck is going on here?

16:08.300 --> 16:09.892
Loki!

16:24.883 --> 16:26.418
Loki!

16:26.418 --> 16:27.749
Stay close to me!

16:32.791 --> 16:37.694
I mail-ordered the newest model,
but there's still no response.

16:38.964 --> 16:42.434
Come to think about it, there's
nothing for them to search for.

16:42.434 --> 16:45.403
Where could Heimdall and Frey be?

16:45.738 --> 16:47.035
Hey, Four-Eyes!

16:48.007 --> 16:50.032
What are you doing over there?

16:50.576 --> 16:52.378
Well, you see, um...

16:52.378 --> 16:55.313
Oh, you're not with Loki, huh?

16:55.547 --> 16:57.674
No. Actually...

17:09.094 --> 17:11.824
These are just like the shadows
I fought yesterday.

17:17.636 --> 17:19.538
There's no such hotel?

17:19.538 --> 17:23.308
Nope. I made a delivery in that
neighborhood just last week.

17:23.308 --> 17:24.910
I'm certain!

17:24.910 --> 17:26.845
Then that means...

17:26.845 --> 17:30.382
Please hurry! Master Loki...
He's in real trouble!

17:30.382 --> 17:32.782
Okay. Hang on tight!

17:33.652 --> 17:35.347
Tight?!

17:36.655 --> 17:38.623
Well, this is for Master Loki too...

17:39.191 --> 17:40.317
Here we go!

17:53.639 --> 17:55.607
There's no end to them!

17:58.777 --> 17:59.971
Mayura!

18:04.783 --> 18:06.751
Mayura, are you all right?

18:08.887 --> 18:11.378
What's going on with this hotel?

18:15.394 --> 18:17.229
This is...

18:17.229 --> 18:18.958
the palace of Glitnir!

18:22.568 --> 18:25.867
Our enemy is the hotel itself!

18:35.881 --> 18:37.178
It's no use.

18:37.716 --> 18:41.286
The fearsome palace of Glitnir,
which sits in judgment of the gods,

18:41.286 --> 18:44.153
will drain you of all your magical powers.

18:45.724 --> 18:46.892
Struggle!

18:46.892 --> 18:49.690
Struggle away in pain, until all your
powers have been exhausted!

18:50.362 --> 18:51.294
Loki!

18:51.864 --> 18:53.991
Mayura! Reiya! Hang on!

18:54.533 --> 18:55.534
Reiya!

18:55.534 --> 18:56.899
Loki!

18:57.336 --> 18:59.463
Help, Lok...

19:00.772 --> 19:01.898
Mayura!

19:07.880 --> 19:09.575
Return Mayura and Reiya!

19:15.521 --> 19:17.156
Master Loki!

19:17.156 --> 19:18.123
Yamino...
Master Loki!

19:22.427 --> 19:24.691
Thor! What is he doing there?!

19:29.301 --> 19:30.669
Master Loki!

19:30.669 --> 19:32.504
This is the palace of Glitnir!

19:32.504 --> 19:34.369
Don't come in, or you won't
be able to leave!

19:34.540 --> 19:36.974
What?! Did you say Glitnir?

19:45.050 --> 19:46.351
Loki!

19:46.351 --> 19:48.187
We need to help him quick!

19:48.187 --> 19:50.382
But what should we do?

19:53.926 --> 19:55.694
We can't go inside...

19:55.694 --> 19:57.796
but maybe we can do
something from here!

19:57.796 --> 19:59.131
Gotcha.

19:59.131 --> 20:00.428
Leave it to me!

20:05.804 --> 20:08.773
In return you can give me breakfast
and dinner for the next month.

20:10.042 --> 20:11.703
Roar, Mjolnir!

20:21.987 --> 20:22.954
Now!

20:37.936 --> 20:40.404
Oh, well. No matter.

20:41.006 --> 20:43.634
I have obtained what I needed.

20:49.681 --> 20:51.750
Master Loki, are you all right?

20:51.750 --> 20:53.718
Yeah, more or less.

21:00.359 --> 21:01.826
Where's Reiya?!

21:03.495 --> 21:08.899
Thanks to the magical energy Loki released,
Freya can now be awoken.

21:12.537 --> 21:15.734
Now, Freya! Awaken!

21:27.919 --> 21:29.079
What's that?!

21:30.589 --> 21:31.757
Looking for Freya

21:31.757 --> 21:32.924
Looking for Freya
Please! I'm searching for this person!

21:32.924 --> 21:34.893
Please! I'm searching for this person!

21:34.893 --> 21:38.021
Has anyone seen this girl?

21:41.700 --> 21:43.235
What is that?

21:43.235 --> 21:44.725
Could it be?

21:56.715 --> 21:58.114
Freya...

22:16.768 --> 22:28.737
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.415 --> 22:42.160
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.160 --> 22:49.368
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.368 --> 22:55.707
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.707 --> 23:05.217
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.217 --> 23:09.554
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.554 --> 23:21.566
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.566 --> 23:23.295
Believe in Heaven

23:31.209 --> 23:32.444
Next Episode

23:32.444 --> 23:35.647
Next Episode
The next episode's key words are,
"waking up," "sentiments," and "aquarium."

23:35.647 --> 23:39.084
Next Episode
Wow, how sexy! She makes me
want to be an adult!

23:39.084 --> 23:41.553
Next Episode
Thank you. But you'll never
be able to be like me

23:41.553 --> 23:44.022
Next Episode
unless you can whirl around
three times and say "woof."

23:44.022 --> 23:46.224
Next Episode
1, 2, 3... Woof!

23:46.224 --> 23:47.726
Next Episode
You didn't really have to do it...

23:47.726 --> 23:49.227
Next Episode
Woof! Woof! Woof-woof-woof-woof-woof!

23:49.227 --> 23:50.429
Next Episode
What? Is there something you want me to do?
Woof! Woof!

23:50.429 --> 23:51.163
Next Episode
What? Is there something you want me to do?

23:51.163 --> 23:52.264
Next Episode
Um... okay, shake!

23:52.264 --> 23:52.931
Next Episode
Woof!
Um... okay, shake!

23:52.931 --> 23:53.398
Next Episode
Shake!

23:53.398 --> 23:53.965
Next Episode
Yes, please! Make it a Large!
Shake!

23:53.965 --> 23:54.399
Next Episode
Yes, please! Make it a Large!

23:54.399 --> 23:54.866
Next Episode
Yes, please! Make it a Large!
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:54.866 --> 23:55.600
Next Episode
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.600 --> 23:56.101
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.101 --> 23:56.268
"The Goddess Freya Awakens!"

23:56.268 --> 23:58.036
The 7th Night
The Goddess Freya Awakens!
"The Goddess Freya Awakens!"

23:58.036 --> 23:59.938
The 7th Night
The Goddess Freya Awakens!
Another strange mystery!

23:59.938 --> 24:00.962
The 7th Night
The Goddess Freya Awakens!
